OL,3,ATrump $1 coin makes him first living
OL,4,Apresident on US currency in a century
OL,5,
OL,6,FFederal law prohibits a living
OL,7,Fpresident from appearing on US
OL,8,Fcurrency, but a design clause in
OL,9,Flegislation for the anniversary was
OL,10,Fused to overcome the ban.
